<p>A good fence gives you privacy, keeps the dog in the yard and makes the whole property look finished. We build custom wood fences and gates for homes around Carleton Place, Lanark County and Ottawa. Zanini Renovations is a fully insured carpentry business based in Carleton Place since 2020, and owner Jonas Zanini is involved from the first measurement to the last gate hinge.</p>

<p>We work in wood only. We don't install chain-link fencing.</p>

